     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On Tue, Aug 21, 2018 at 5:33 PM, Jean-Baka Domelevo Entfellner <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">dome...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div>"
